SUMMARY:The Roaring 420's: Great Gatsby Party
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of decadence\, indulgence\, and elevated highs at Mercy’s Roaring 420’s Gatsby Costume Party-a fully immersive 1920s-inspired cannabis experience inside The Lounge. \nOn Saturday\, April 18th from 6PM – 10PM\, we’re transforming the space into a lavish Gatsby-era affair where luxury meets smoke-filled sophistication. Velvet nights\, golden details\, and jazz-era energy set the tone-brought to life by a live performance from Fog City Swing\, delivering a one-of-a-kind soundtrack of classic swing\, modern hits\, and big band flair. Their signature “smallest big band” sound creates an electric\, dance-worthy atmosphere you won’t find anywhere else. \nYour ticket includes a full dinner experience\, a curated goodie bag\, and your own assigned seat-so you can settle in and enjoy the night in style. \nThis isn’t just a party-it’s an experience. \nSip on herbal cannabis-infused cocktails\, explore interactive brand stations\, and indulge in guided tasting options designed to elevate your palate. Watch the craft come alive at our live joint rolling area\, try your luck with casino-style games\, and discover curated moments of entertainment throughout the night. \nAnd of course-dress to impress. \nWe’re hosting a Gatsby Costume Contest\, so come in your finest flapper dresses\, sharpest suits\, and boldest 1920s looks for a chance to stand out and take the spotlight for the night. \nThis is a fully immersive themed experience\, and guests are highly encouraged to participate in the dress code to bring the night to life. \nDate and Time: \nDate: Saturday\, April 18\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 – 10:00 PM \nTicket Tiers: \n$100 Reserved Inside Seating Ticket. Perfect for guests who want premium comfort and a front-row seat to the night’s festivities. Enjoy the full Gatsby treatment with reserved indoor seating in the heart of the action. Ticket includes: gourmet dinner\, exclusive goodie bag and access to the immersive Roaring 420’s experience \n$75 Open Outside Seating Ticket. Ideal for a more relaxed\, social vibe under the night sky. Soak in the atmosphere with open outdoor seating while still enjoying all the indulgences of the evening. Ticket includes: gourmet dinner\, exclusive goodie bag and access to the immersive Roaring 420’s experience \n21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC \nURLs: \nTickets: https://go.evvnt.com/3562690-0?pid=5514\nInstagram: https://go.evvnt.com/3562690-3?pid=5514 \nPrices: \n$75 Open Outside Seating Ticket: USD 75.00\n$100 Reserved Inside Seating Ticket.: USD 100.00 \nArtist: Fog City Swing Band \nCategory: Live Music \nVenue Details: The Lounge at Mercy\, 7950 Redwood Drive\, Cotati\, California\, 94931\, United States
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-roaring-420s-great-gatsby-party/
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy\, 7950 Redwood Drive\, Cotati\, 94931
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/The-Roaring-420s-Great-Gatsby-Party-mercy.jpg
GEO:38.33308;-122.71387
