SUMMARY:Comedian Nancy Norton at Buena Vista Winery
DESCRIPTION:The Laugh Cellar presents: Headliner Nancy Norton\nHistoric Wine Tool Museum at Buena Vista Winery\nColorado-based headliner Nancy Norton can boast winning Best of the Fest alongside Jay Leno at the Burbank Comedy Festival. She is the champion of the 40th Annual Seattle International Comedy Competition and made history as the first woman to win the Boston Comedy Festival.\nHigh-energy and fast-paced\, this award-winning comedian connects effortlessly with audiences of all ages. Nancy has an uncanny ability to read the room\, weaving spontaneous moments into a uniquely interactive performance. Some even call it a healing experience.\nComplimentary parking on-site\nIndoor event\, theater style seating\nDoors 6:00pm  / Showtime 7:00pm \nAVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE:\nA delicious selection of wine and sparkling wine by the bottle and glass\nOakville Cheese & Charcuterie plates\nPlease no outside alcohol\nNo pets\, service dogs ok – please provide valid license\nShow is open to an audience 21+
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/comedian-nancy-norton/
LOCATION:Buena Vista Winery\, 18000 Old Winery Rd\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Comedy-Nancy-Norton.jpg
GEO:38.30018;-122.42222
