SUMMARY:Defeated Sanity at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:A brutal night of death metal as Defeated Sanity leads an all-out assault at The California Theatre.\nPrepare for an unrelenting night of extreme metal as Defeated Sanity storms the stage with support from Inferi\, Organectomy\, Excrescence\, and Bog Body. This stacked lineup delivers technical precision\, crushing heaviness\, and raw intensity\, an essential show for death metal fans. \nAll ages welcome. Doors open at 6:30 PM\, show starts at 7:00 PM. Tickets are $25 ADV / $30 DOS.\nLimited tickets remain at caltheatre.com\, with additional tickets available via Eventbrite:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/defeated-sanity-at-the-california-theatre-tickets-1977481459277
