SUMMARY:Joose at the Vintage Space
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, April 18th\, Vintage Space at The Flamingo transforms into a high-octane rock haven as JOOSE\, Santa Rosa’s own legendary ’90s rock cover band\, takes the stage! \nWhy You Can’t Miss This: JOOSE is more than a band—they’re a full-throttle nostalgia machine\, delivering electrifying renditions of rock anthems from Nirvana\, Green Day\, Sublime\, Metallica\, and more! With a setlist that feels like the ultimate mixtape of your favorite ’90s rock hits\, JOOSE has been packing North Bay venues with their high-energy performances and unmatched vibes. \nWho’s in JOOSE?Fronted by the powerhouse vocals of James Erickson and backed by the thunderous rhythm section of Scott Essig\, Mitch Nunley\, and Dan Sartin\, JOOSE brings every note and riff to life with pure passion and precision. \nThe Venue:Vintage Space at The Flamingo is the ultimate spot for an unforgettable night. Its retro-modern vibe and intimate setting make it the perfect backdrop for JOOSE’s explosive performance. \nGrab your tickets early—this WILL sell out!\nHit the bar for craft cocktails\, and fuel up with bites before the show. \nBring your crew and your loudest singing voice—this is the night to rock out!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/joose-at-the-vintage-space/
LOCATION:Vintage Space at The Flamingo Resort\, 2777 Fourth St.\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.45182;-122.68916
