SUMMARY:Windsor's Earth Day Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Earth Day festivities:\nSustainable giveaways and a Climate Pledge\nKids’ activities\, crafts\, lawn games\, and a trash truck\nWindsor Certified Farmers’ Market\nLocal nonprofits and exhibitors working toward a better future\nTraditional Indigenous dance blessings\nTown Green murals such as the “Wisdom Tree” installation at the Huerta Gym and the new “Celebrating Sonoma County’s Biodiversity” installation at Market St and McClelland Dr\nFree bike valet!\nPlus\, sign your household items up to get repaired at the Reuse and Repair Fair – April 19 from 10am-1pm in the Huerta Gymnasium\nFacilitated by the Reuse Alliance\, Zero Waste Sonoma\, and the Town of Windsor
