SUMMARY:Sonoma Overlook Trail • Spring Hike and Light Lunch @ Sonoma Raceway
DESCRIPTION:Buy your tickets now for our unforgettable spring hike through the hills of Sonoma Raceway’s 1\,600-acre property on Sunday\, April 19 at 10 am. Gates open at 9:30\, event will end by 3 pm. Revel in fabulous bay and vineyard views with wildflowers and quite possibly “woolly weeders” hard at work. Enjoy a three- or five-mile route; a light lunch will follow. Registration is limited and is $50 per person\, non-refundable. This event is our biggest fundraiser of the year\, and we always sell out\, so early registration is advised! \nAll proceeds will benefit the all-volunteer Sonoma Overlook Trail Stewards to help keep the trail in tip-top shape. We stewards will be on hand to hike along with you. This is a great opportunity to support your local trail and take in the panorama of open space along San Pablo Bay. \nWe receive upwards of 60\,000 visits a year\, so our work continues year round to keep the Overlook in shape. Your support keeps our trail system open to all levels of hikers.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-overlook-trail-spring-hike-and-light-lunch-sonoma-raceway/
LOCATION:Sonoma Raceway\, 29355 Arnold Dr.\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
